WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.482
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:11.483 --> 00:00:15.762
I'm an African lion.

3
00:00:15.763 --> 00:00:20.451
We are very big cats.

4
00:00:20.452 --> 00:00:25.867
African lions live in Africa, right?

5
00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:27.802
Right!

6
00:00:27.803 --> 00:00:32.752
We live near grasslands and woodlands.

7
00:00:32.753 --> 00:00:36.268
Do you live alone?

8
00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:40.558
Other big cats live alone.

9
00:00:40.559 --> 00:00:45.592
But lions live in groups called prides.

10
00:00:45.593 --> 00:00:52.872
A pride usually has about 15 lions.

11
00:00:52.873 --> 00:00:55.890
I like your mane.

12
00:00:55.891 --> 00:01:00.849
Only male lions have manes.

13
00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:06.259
The manes make us look bigger.

14
00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:16.361
That helps us to protect our pride.

15
00:01:16.362 --> 00:01:20.303
You roar loudly!

16
00:01:20.304 --> 00:01:25.367
Male lions roar more than females.

17
00:01:25.368 --> 00:01:29.438
We roar to call our prides.

18
00:01:29.439 --> 00:01:34.255
We also scare other animals away.

19
00:01:34.256 --> 00:01:36.893
What do you eat?

20
00:01:36.894 --> 00:01:43.202
We mostly eat wildebeests, zebras, and antelopes.

21
00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:48.553
Sometimes we eat small rodents too.

22
00:01:48.554 --> 00:01:51.510
Do you go hunting?

23
00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:57.384
No. Female lions hunt for the whole pride.

24
00:01:57.385 --> 00:02:06.274
They go together at night.

25
00:02:06.275 --> 00:02:10.953
I see another lion coming.

26
00:02:10.954 --> 00:02:16.106
I must protect our territory!

27
00:02:16.107 --> 00:02:23.412
Good-bye, African Lion!

